      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEERS JAX (2) jumped cleanly last start and led all the way (17.14) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 300m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings seven times from 10 starts. Can make it two on the bounce. NALAH PATANGA (1) was below best at her last start when 6th at this track following a win (22.84) there two back. Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Has the ability to give this a shake. BOLT OF FUN (6) was racing consistently, recording four minors on end, before colliding in the run last time and finishing fourth in a Free For All at this track (22.92). Must include in calculations. BERN WEST BOLTER (7) placed last time and cannot be ignored.",
